WEBVTT

l1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.400
Some folks count their money

l2
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.800
Some folks count their sheep

l3
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.400
I count what's left in the pocket of a coat

l4
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.000
Before I go to sleep

l5
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.200
Sixteen treats and a walk in the rain

l6
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.800
Sixteen treats and I'd do it again

l7
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.400
You can keep your silver, keep your gold

l8
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.000
Sixteen treats is all I hold

l9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.600
Boss says sit, and brother, I sit

l10
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.200
Boss says wait, and I wait a bit

l11
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.800
But the second that the cupboard makes a sound

l12
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.400
There ain't a dog in the county gonna hold me down

l13
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.600
Sixteen treats and a walk in the rain

l14
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:23.200
Sixteen treats and I'd do it again

l15
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.800
Count 'em out slow, count 'em out true

l16
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:36.000
Fifteen for me and one for you
